                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After playing over 7 hours I originally voted to not recommend this because of not getting past the first \"death level\". I left some feedback, went on to more games, then came back here to \"try one more time\". The dev must have responded, as it now has a \"start round\" button and also a slow/fast toggle, awesome! Now the death level is just too easy! Lol. \n\nMore info: I have only unlocked 7 or so turrets so far, and so far they cover the standard TD turret types. Each one has 2-5 upgrade types with 3-5 upgrade levels. The upgrades all vary, on one if enough levels turret fires twice, splash damage, scatter reduction, etc. Had to nock it down from 4K to something reasonable like 1080p (From the FPS counters it confirms I have a slow CPU), but hey this is a TD game ;-). The levels vary as well, all in all a great game for the price! Looking forward to a great gaming season ;-)",
